(text "External HUSB238: keep 5V jumper CLOSED; cut 1A and leave 2A OPEN to request 3A. Verify unloaded output first." (at 18 255 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 52110ad2-734b-5b3c-a819-a5604aef205c))
(text "Q1: drain = FUSED5, source = 5V_SYS, gate = R1 to GND. Reverse-polarity protection, NOT an eFuse or OVP." (at 18 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid eeb2fafd-504c-5781-bb86-955a89c05d8a))
(text "Use only the qualified 5 V / 3 A PD adapter. Test C1 inrush; F1 derates with enclosure temperature." (at 18 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0794aabe-3ed3-5d19-86f8-ad190de03f95))
(text "SN74AHCT1G125 is TTL-compatible. Do not substitute an HC buffer. Keep the LED cable under 100 mm." (at 18 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ac435176-2146-5871-9a68-2bd1ff96ea19))
